# Composite step для открытия главной страницы (без параметров)
Composite step: Open SauceDemo homepage
Given I am on main application page
When I wait until element located by caseSensitiveText(Swag Labs) appears
Then ${current-page-url} is equal to https://www.saucedemo.com/
When I take screenshot

# Composite step для логина (с параметрами)
Composite step: Login as user ${login} with password ${password}
When I enter '${login}' into the element located by css selector "#user-name"
And I enter '${password}' into the element located by css selector "#password"
And I click on the element located by css selector "#login-button"
Then the page title is equal to "Swag Labs"
And I take screenshot
